    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113-a36">

                <pb facs="0292" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg220"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 35 in No. 331.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Barrows</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Jail, Naas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 28,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: As requested by yours of the 25th instant,
                    I herewith forward certificate of naturalization, which I have just received
                    from my friends.</p>
                <p>I believe that, according to the theory even of British law, I am illegally
                    detained here, as the warrant under which I was arrested was issued for John
                    White, whereas my name is James White, and notwithstanding I protested at the
                    time I was arrested tinder it and since detained.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed>JAMES L. WHITE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
